# S14 (hold / apply), guest g (k2): waits at the title until the owner has left, then enters the lobby. Its card's flag
# 501 (set by the lobby's first.lua) is new to the room and plausible there: hold keeps it on the server until the owner
# returns, apply merges it at once; either way the lobby gate's barrier into stag0101 leaves it in g's engine.
idle until epoch>=@50
log owner gone
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
log in the lobby
idle until frames>=300 fail flag:501=0
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
idle until frames>=120 fail flag:501=0
log 501 kept
idle until frames>=60
